## Disable Conflicting xCAT Exports

The head node exports `/home` and `/opt/ohpc/pub`; disable the default
xCAT-managed `/tftpboot` and `/install` export entries so they do not conflict.

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Disable conflicting xCAT exports -->
```bash
sed -i "s|/tftpboot|#/tftpboot|" /etc/exports
sed -i "s|/install|#/install|"   /etc/exports
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->
